MOGIKANIN firmware for Xiaomi AX3000T
=====================================

The firmware images published in this repository's Releases are built with the
official OpenWrt ImageBuilder and contain third-party software:

* OpenWrt 25.12.6 (r33311-981c978eff) and its packages
  License: GPL-2.0 and others (see each package)
  Source:  https://github.com/openwrt/openwrt/tree/v25.12.6
           https://github.com/openwrt/luci
           https://github.com/openwrt/packages
           https://downloads.openwrt.org/releases/25.12.6/

* Xray-core 26.11.9 (/usr/bin/xray, official release Xray-linux-arm64-v8a.zip,
  SHA256 64ed6858982a7f5eb85d88b811089063bd4f17561f4c8f44e0f1dc8e6f6430be)
  License: MPL-2.0
  Source:  https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core/tree/v26.11.9

* LuCI theme Footstrap (luci-theme-footstrap) — part of LuCI, Apache-2.0.

Unmodified upstream binaries are used. The changes made by this project are the
files under `files/` and the build script under `build/` (MIT, see LICENSE).

